            <div xml:id="d507">

                <pb facs="0587" n="521" xml:id="pg521"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.1731/72: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Dawson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-09-29T11:00:00-06:00">September 29, 1934—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 2:20 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>158. Yes. Congress will probably adjourn October 5th; next regular session starts
                    December 15th and lasts under constitution for 45 to 60 “meetings” (not
                    days).</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dawson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
